    <span id="skip-content" tabindex="-1"></span>    <h1>Services and support for you and your child</h1>
  </div>

  
  </div>
<div class="panel-pane pane-node-content odd" >
  
      
  
  <div class="pane-content">
        <article id="node-7033" class="node node-topic-sheet view-mode-full clearfix" about="/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child" typeof="sioc:Item foaf:Document">
    <header>
            <span property="dc:title" content="Services and support for you and your child" class="rdf-meta element-hidden"></span>      </header>
    <div class="field field-name-field-intro-text field-type-text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><p class="intro-text">Find out about the services and support available to you and your child. </p></div></div></div><div class="field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even" property="content:encoded"><p>You and your child will need lots of help and support in the first few years.&nbsp;Find out about&nbsp;<a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/health-services-your-child">health services for your child</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;your child&#39;s&nbsp;<a href="../../new-zealand-health-system/eligibility-publicly-funded-health-services">eligibility for publicly funded health and disability services.</a></p>

<p>All&nbsp;children in New Zealand are able to get free <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/well-child-tamariki-ora-visits">Well Child Tamariki Ora services</a> and <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/immunise-your-child">immunisations</a>. <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/health-services-your-child">Health services for your child</a>&nbsp;include your child&#39;s&nbsp;<a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/your-childs-doctor-and-practice-nurse">doctor and practice nurse</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/your-childs-dental-care">dental care</a>&nbsp;and the <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/helplines-health-and-parenting-advice">helplines for&nbsp;health and parenting advice</a>.</p>

<p>There is also support&nbsp;for&nbsp;<a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/children-serious-conditions-and-special-needs">children with serious conditions and special needs</a>&nbsp;and families affected by&nbsp;<a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/family-violence-and-young-families">family violence</a>.</p>
</div></div></div>    </article>
  </div>

  
  </div>
<div class="panel-pane pane-node-links even" >
  
      
  
  <div class="pane-content">
