  <div class="pane-content">
        <div class="view view-sub-pages view-id-sub_pages view-display-id-block view-dom-id-e6d5d36e92e63faf9b60dd17570d4640">
        
  
  
      <div class="view-content">
      <div class="item-list">    <ul>          <li class="views-row views-row-1 views-row-odd views-row-first">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/health-services-your-child">Health services for your child</a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">Find out about the health services available to support you, your child and whānau.
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/health-services-your-child">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-2 views-row-even">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/well-child-tamariki-ora-visits">Well Child Tamariki Ora visits</a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">The Well Child Tamariki Ora programme is a series of health visits and support that are free to all families for children from around 6 weeks up to 5 years of age.
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/well-child-tamariki-ora-visits">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-3 views-row-odd">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/your-childs-doctor-and-practice-nurse">Your child’s doctor and practice nurse</a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">In the early years you and your child will need lots of help and advice about sickness and keeping healthy.
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/your-childs-doctor-and-practice-nurse">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-4 views-row-even">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/immunise-your-child">Immunise your child</a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">Immunisation protects your child from some serious but preventable diseases and helps to stop those diseases spreading.
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/immunise-your-child">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-5 views-row-odd">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/your-childs-dental-care">Your child’s dental care</a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">Looking after your child&rsquo;s teeth is important. Healthy baby teeth are needed for chewing and proper speech development.&nbsp;
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/your-childs-dental-care">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-6 views-row-even">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/children-serious-conditions-and-special-needs">Children with serious conditions and special needs </a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">If you or your child have special needs because of a long-term disability or serious condition, your doctor, midwife or nurse may refer you to a Needs Assessment and Service Coordination (NASC) service.
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/children-serious-conditions-and-special-needs">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-7 views-row-odd">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/family-violence-and-young-families">Family violence and young families</a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">Being pregnant and having a baby can be stressful. For some families and couples, this is when family violence starts.&nbsp;
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/family-violence-and-young-families">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-8 views-row-even views-row-last">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-title">        <div class="field-content">
<div class="views-field views-field-title">
  <h3 class="field-content">
    <a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/helplines-health-and-parenting-advice">Helplines – health and parenting advice</a>  </h3>
</div></div>  </div>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-body">        <span class="field-content">Call Healthline on 0800 611 116 if you need health advice about your baby or child. Call PlunketLine on 0800 933 922 if you need advice about child health or parenting.
</span>  </span>  
  <span class="views-field views-field-view-node">        <span class="field-content"><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/helplines-health-and-parenting-advice">Read more</a></span>  </span></li>
      </ul></div>    </div>
  
  
  
  
  
  
</div>  </div>

  
  </div>
</div>      <div class='panel-panel right col-xs-12 col-md-3 col-lg-3'><div class="panel-pane pane-views pane-related-content-revisioning view-promo-blocks even" >
  
      
  
  <div class="pane-content">
        <div class="view view-related-content-revisioning view-id-related_content_revisioning view-display-id-block view-dom-id-008d7b394c51e322a2eb5ede5d8b6cf7">
        
  
  
      <div class="view-content">
      <div class="item-list">    <ul>          <li class="views-row views-row-1 views-row-odd views-row-first">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-body">        <div class="field-content"><p class="image-center"><img alt="Healthline" height="65" src="../../sites/default/files/images/yourhealth/pregkids/healthline-promo-small.jpg" width="209" /></p>

<div style="padding:0em 0em 0.5em 0.5em;">Call <strong><a href="../services-and-support/health-care-services/healthline">Healthline</a></strong> on <a href="tel:0800611116">0800 611 116</a> for health advice.</div>

<hr style="margin:0em" />
<div style="padding:0em 0em 0.5em 0.5em;">
<p class="image-center"><img alt="Phone PlunketLine on 0800 933 922" height="111" src="../../sites/default/files/images/Promotiles/plunket-logo.png" width="150" /></p>

<p>Call <strong><a href="https://www.plunket.org.nz/what-we-do/what-we-offer/plunketline/">PlunketLine</a></strong> on <a href="tel:0800933922">0800 933 922</a> for&nbsp;parenting&nbsp;advice.</p>
</div>
</div>  </div></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-2 views-row-even">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-body">        <div class="field-content"><p class="image-center"><a href="https://www.orangatamariki.govt.nz/assets/Uploads/Children-in-our-care/Getting-ready-for-independence/Hand-in-hand-book-May-2018.pdf"><img alt="Hand in Hand Book" height="140" src="../../sites/default/files/images/yourhealth/resources/handinhandbook.jpg" width="95" /></a></p>

<div style="padding:0.5em 0em 0.5em 0.5em;">The <strong><a href="https://www.orangatamariki.govt.nz/assets/Uploads/Children-in-our-care/Getting-ready-for-independence/Hand-in-hand-book-May-2018.pdf">Hand in Hand Book</a></strong>&nbsp;(<a href="https://orangatamariki.govt.nz">orangatamariki.govt.nz</a>)&nbsp;tells you about the health and education services your child can get.</div>
</div>  </div></li>
          <li class="views-row views-row-3 views-row-odd views-row-last">  
  <div class="views-field views-field-body">        <div class="field-content"><div style="padding:0.5em 0em 0.5em 0.5em;">
<h3 class="h4">You might also be interested in...</h3>

<ul>
	<li><strong><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/first-year/helpful-advice-during-first-year?icn=promo-childservices&amp;ici=helpful1st">Helpful advice during the first year</a></strong><br />
	Information and advice to support you during baby&rsquo;s first year.</li>
	<li><strong><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/under-fives/helpful-advice-years-1-5?icn=promo-childservices&amp;ici=helpfulolder">Helpful advice for years 1 to 5</a></strong><br />
	Find out about caring for your child from 1 to 5 years of age.</li>
	<li><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/under-fives/helpful-advice-years-1-5/managing-your-childs-behaviour?icn=promo-childservices&amp;ici=behaviour"><strong>Managing your child&rsquo;s behaviour</strong></a><br />
	If you want your child to behave in a certain way, they need you to show them.</li>
	<li><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/family-violence-and-young-families?icn=promo-childservices&amp;ici=familyviolence"><strong>Family violence and young families</strong></a><br />
	If you feel unsafe it&rsquo;s important that you get help.</li>
	<li><strong><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/first-year/helpful-advice-during-first-year/baby-and-child-sickness-danger-signs?icn=promo-childservices&amp;ici=sickness">Baby and child sickness &ndash; danger signs</a></strong><br />
	Get help quickly if your child shows any of these danger signs.</li>
	<li><a href="https://www.health.govt.nz/your-health/pregnancy-and-kids/services-and-support-you-and-your-child/immunise-your-child?icn=promo-childservices&amp;ici=immunise"><strong>Immunise your child</strong></a><br />
	Immunisation protects your child from some serious but preventable diseases.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>  </div></li>
      </ul></div>    </div>
  
  
  
  
  
  
